            "review_title": "Review at High City",
            "review_text": "Sergey K\nHanoi, Vietnam57 contributions\n0\nVery cozy place in the middle of the Old Quater\nFeb 2016 • Friends\nLet me just say in advance, I might be bias, cause my friends own this place. However, I will try my best to stay as objective as possible.\n\nThe location is great, it is right in the central part of The Older Quarter. The bar is located on the second floor. there is balcony, so you can sit there and enjoy the life of a bustling city. \n\nMenu: mostly drinks, but there is some choice of decent snacks. \n\nStaff: extremely helpful and friendly. Be aware, when you order Gin-tonic , remind NOT to put salt in it =) Vietnamese-style gin-tonic is not my cup of tea =)\n\nFeatures: almost every friday/saturday there is a live band playing, totally worth it!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 29, 2016",
